extends layout

block content
    div#indexContent
      p I'm Lyss Billington, and welcome to #{title}! My own little corner of the internet I've carved out for myself.

      p I'm a software developer from Atlantic Canada, and when I'm not busy taking care of my cat, I spend my time learning cool and exciting ways to engage with the world of web development. To the left (or above, if you're on mobile!) you'll see links to my GitHub, LinkedIn, and other social media. Give me a looksie!

      p I'm always looking for new ways I can contribute and make cool and interesting things.
      br
      br
      br
      svg.icon(viewBox="0 0 24 24", fill="none", stroke="currentColor",
         stroke-width="1.5", stroke-linecap="round", stroke-linejoin="round",
         aria-hidden="true")

        //- screen
        rect(x="4", y="5", width="16", height="11", rx="1.5")
        //- base
        path(d="M2 19h20l-1.5-3h-17z")
        //- trackpad notch
        path(d="M10 17.5h4")
    h3 Tech Skills
    h5 Command Line
    p Comfortable using the terminal to navigate my every-day workflow. Though Bash is my preferred shell, I'm also familiar with both zsh and PowerShell from their integrations with macOS and Windows
    h5 Languages
    p HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript (ES5), Python, C#, Java
    h5 Database
    p Familiar with Oracle SQL, MySQL MSSQL, MongoDB, NoSQL, and even the odd Excel spreadsheet when the time calls for it.
    h5 Server-Side
    .NET Core, .NET Framework, NodeJS, Express, Tomcat
    br
    br
