    h3 Projects
    h5 dmg-calc -
        a GitHub
    p A Windows application made in Visual Studio that runs the mathematical process to determine what the damage multiplier of a given Pokemon move will be, based on attacking type, defending type(s), held items, weather conditions, terrain, and more.
    h5 pkmn-dmg-calc -
        a GitHub
    p Refactored and rewrote the above application in JavaScript and made it useable in CLI via NodeJS and packages like Chalk and  Inquirer.
